  "critical_assessment": "Complete results and mandatory requirements were inspected. The reused label and equality-ordering procedures address actual parser and proof errors. The reference-table source proof prefix is exposed once and its original consumer uses it. Generic component-meaning preservation is reused for each native initial call. The explicit eight-call list is independently stated using public argument formatters and keeps both equal record-instance occurrences; it must still be compared to actual compiled-clause expansion and executed. Neither a passed comparison nor the closed final-judgment theorem will substitute for that runtime.",
